#  Single-page-app fallback.
#
#  Files in public/ are copied verbatim into dist/ by Vite, so this ends up at the root of the
#  deployed site. Netlify and Render Static Sites both read it.
#
#  Meaning: serve index.html for any path that is not a real file, with HTTP 200 so the URL in
#  the address bar is preserved for React Router to read.
/*    /index.html   200
